      "writtenOn": "2021-01-21T07:49:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a bug while transition window is too low in RT1715.\nSo transition window is set as 46.67us.\nWith 7 counts in 46.67us, there is no compliance issue with USB testers and other devices so far.",
